## iti83
iti83:1.1 | S: This was said by the Buddha, the Perfected One: that is what I heard. | T: (none)
iti83:2.1 | S: “Mendicants, when a god is due to pass away from the realm of the gods, five harbingers appear. | T: “Monks, when a deva is about to pass away from the company of devas, five omens appear:
