iti83:2.3 | S: When the other gods know that that godling is due to pass away, they wish them well in three ways: | T: The devas, knowing from this that ‘This deva-son is about to pass away,’ encourage him with three sayings:
iti83:2.4 | S: ‘Sir, may you go from here to a good place! | T: ‘Go from here, honorable sir, to a good destination.
iti83:3.1 | S: When you have gone to a good place, may you be blessed with good fortune! | T: Having gone to a good destination, gain the gain that is good to gain.
iti83:4.1 | S: When you have been blessed with good fortune, may you become well grounded!’” | T: Having gained the gain that is good to gain, become well-established.’”
